# This repo is developed on both Windows (hpstation, MinGW) and Linux (hpnix, NixOS).
# Normalize everything to LF in the repo and in both working trees so a file edited
# on one machine does not show up as a whole-file diff on the other.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows entry points must stay CRLF (cmd.exe is happier with them)
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# binaries
*.png binary
*.exe binary
